            "description": "Stereo delay modelled on the Logic Pro Stereo Delay: per-side input select, delay time, low/high cut, feedback, crossfeed and phase, plus Straight/Crossed/Ping-Pong routing. Every control is de-zippered and delay-time changes crossfade instead of jumping, so nothing clicks while you tweak it."
